months I would guess.<br /> <br /> NWoD 2nd ed core is nearly done when last I checked. No dates on any of those.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-09T10:21:37-07:00","id":695093,"title":"","content":"There are four <b>Requiem </b>supplements planned:<br /> <br /> <b>Secrets of the Covenants<br /> Half Damned<br /> A Thousand Years of Night<br /> Guide to the Night</b><br /> <br /> As mentioned, Secrets of the Covenants is still in second drafts. The other three haven't been mentioned in the Monday updates yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-09T10:24:51-07:00","id":695095,"title":"","content":"I wonder if they could get a splat-based Patreon going to give the developer and writers some extra cash and monetary incentive to do things too small for a book that they could put on the blog, like bloodlines and clans, NPCs and stuff. Could all be compiled later for a book, if wanted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-09T13:15:19-07:00","id":695281,"title":"","content":"Whats a Guide to the Night?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-09T14:29:18-07:00","id":695391,"title":"","content":"Vampire: The Requiem Guide to the Night \u2013 Specific guidelines for getting the most out of Vampire: The Requiem 2nd Edition for both players and Storytellers. Includes Three Tier advice for setting your Chronicle and additional ways to expand your characters and Chronicles. 212 pages. PDF/PoD. <br /> <br /> It was mentioned in the GenCon <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/153331/Onyx-Path-20152016-Publishing-Brochure\" target=\"_blank\">brochure</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-09T16:11:31-07:00","id":695432,"title":"","content":"<i>Secrets of the Covenants</i> is almost ready for editing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-29T18:43:56-07:00","id":740498,"title":"","content":"is it overly greedy to ask for an update with exalted 3rd edition and beast being out?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-29T20:20:52-07:00","id":740726,"title":"","content":"I think we got the open dev playtesting for everyone, though I don't believe much was actually playtested. My vampire game ended shortly before the first one, which was a shame as the Circle sorcery would have really helped out. But we've seen most of the mechanics, what else is there?<br /> <br /> I guess it would be cool to know who the voice characters are, if it's written that way and not going to ruin secrets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-10T07:08:01-08:00","id":762278,"title":"","content":"oh when will we get some tidbits on &quot;The Half damned?&quot; any ideas<br /> <br /> Am looking forward to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-10T07:21:02-08:00","id":762285,"title":"","content":"Probably not until after Secrets of the Covenants comes out, maybe not even until after a Thousand Years of Night.<br /> <br /> Until then, 'There are creatures more than kin and less than kine. The ghouls, ever-so-loyal until they finally break. The revenants, half-vampires born of spontaneous Embrace. And the dhampir, the impossible children of vampires and mortals. Half-Damned gives players and Storytellers everything needed to incorporate them in a game.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T02:43:12-08:00","id":762959,"title":"","content":"I want half damned so much.<br /> Will they all be reddy by Chistmas?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T07:14:44-08:00","id":763079,"title":"","content":"Probably not. It looks like Secrets of the Covenants is in editing, however, which is near the end of the process. It doesn't look like it's entered art direction yet, however.<br /> <br /> This can all be seen on the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/category/news/monday-meeting/\" target=\"_blank\">Monday Meeting updates</a>, where it shows the relative place of things in the development process.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-12T13:26:13-08:00","id":764342,"title":"","content":"Yes, it's in editing and that's going well. For art direction, Mike and I need to toss around some ideas, since five out of six sections are artifact collections.<br /> <br /> EDIT:<br /> <br /> <i>Guide to the Night</i> is a fairly ambitious project, which is going to aim to provide a complete guide to running and playing <i>Vampire</i>. Techniques, best practices, and so on, aimed at a spectrum of player/Storyteller experience.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":2,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","user":"Rose Bailey","date":". 11-12-2015, 04:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-12T15:52:32-08:00","id":764463,"title":"","content":"Ooh, the half-Damned book definitely piques my interest, as well! Dhampiri are always fun. Instant, off the cuff inspiration:<br /> <br /> Damon was about to leave the club before he saw her. All pounding bass and screeching electronica, no substance. Was a great place to get a nip or some tail, but he wasn't feeling it tonight. Too many stick figures rolling on mollies. He was about to text his favorite blood doll when she appeared, making her way through the crowd with impossible grace. Her every movement was sure and supple, hips swaying as she danced through the throng. Dark hair, pale skin, and eyes so blue he swore they almost glowed in the misty light. Damon might have thought her Kindred if he didn't smell the sweat and perfume on her, flowery and intoxicating. Her heart beat strong within her chest, beads of glistening sweat coursing over the curves above it. Damn if she wasn't the sexiest thing he'd ever seen.<br /> <br /> Hands held high above her head, she pressed up against him, dancing with the light step of a ballerina and the raw animal sex appeal of a stripper. Damon wasted no time in wrapping her up tight, forcing blood through his system to make sure she knew just how interested he was. Strange that she sought him out specifically. &quot;Mikhail sent me,&quot; she said, as if guessing his thoughts. Damon grinned. <i>Mikhail, you big Russkie bastard, I'll owe you for tonight. </i>&quot;Good,&quot; he said, &quot;then you know what I want. What's your name, sexy?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Evelyn. But you can call me 'Eve.'&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Like the douche,&quot; Damon said, smirking like a high school kid who thought he was witty.<br /> <br /> Eve just smiled. &quot;Yes. And you know what <i>I </i>want.&quot; <div align=\"center\">* * *</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> They tumbled out of the back door into the alley, mouths pressed together, knocking over a garbage can and spilling its contents. It was red hot passion, desire unbound, all groping hands and roaming tongues. Damon bit his tongue and let some of his precious blood sweeten her pretty little painted lips. &quot;More where that came from if I like you, doll,&quot; he said, holding her against the wall with an iron grip. He reached down to unzip his pants. &quot;Starting with sucking me off.&quot; Damon swung her around and leaned back into the wall.<br /> <br /> Eve knelt down slowly, deliberately, looking up into his eyes with lust curling her lips. Damon all but shook with anticipation. The Beast riled; it was hungry for her, too, but it had to wait its turn. This girl was unbelievable. If he'd been mortal, he'd have gone off already and still wanted\u2014<br /> <br /> She stood up and the look in her eyes suddenly changed to one of hatred. Evelyn spit in disgust. Puzzled, Damon was too slow to catch on. &quot;Hey, bitch, if you're going waste it like that, you ain't gettin' more until I'm done with that pretty little mouth of yours. Now I said <i>suck me off</i>.&quot; Damon glowered at her, bending his will and his blood magic to make her a willing little blood-whore. She dropped down again.<br /> <br /> &quot;That's fucking right. Do what I tell you from now on, and maybe I won't break you in half with my nine-inch\u2014&quot;<br /> <br /> Evelyn rose up swifter than a striking cobra, pounding her fist on his chest. No, not just her fist. Damon fell back against the wall feeling like an elephant sat right on his sternum. His limbs went cold, leaden, and he leaned paralyzed against the grimy brick. &quot;What ... the ... fuck did you ... do to me?&quot; he gasped. He looked down, horrified to see a slender wooden stake jutting from his chest. His eyes bulged as he realized there was a name etched into it: <i>Damon</i>.<br /> Eve wiped her lips with the back of her hand. &quot;You're wondering how you're still conscious, aren't you? You see, I learned how to stake you things just right so that you stay awake, but can't move.&quot; As she spoke, Evelyn walked calmly over to the fallen garbage can and rooted through it. Damon's eyes followed her but he could hardly muster up any words. When she turned back to him, she held something in her hands\u2014a blade, silver, slender and curved, like a little samurai sword or something. Damon could hardly believe it. He tried to shake his head as she walked back over to him.<br /> <br /> &quot;I ... g-got friends ... stupid ... little ... bit\u2014&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;No you don't. Like I said, Mikhail sent me. Right before I cut off his head. He sold you out. Tried to make a deal to save his own worthless hide. Just like his so-called 'friends' did before him. The whole pack of you are cowards. No honor. No compassion. No restraint.&quot; She held up a stained newspaper also taken from the spilled garbage. Eve opened it to page three and pointed to an article with a small picture of a high school girl smiling cheerily. The headline read, &quot;Local High School Junior Found Dead.&quot; Eve shoved the article in his face.<br /> <br /> &quot;That girl was seventeen. Her whole future ahead of her. Your contacts got it pushed back to the third page. She didn't even merit a front page article, because of you!&quot; Evelyn's eyes glinted silver-blue, and this time Damon realized the faint glow was very real. &quot;I know you killed her. I know you and your friends got her high, shared her like you were passing around a bottle, then left her in a ditch and made it look like she was abducted while working the corner. You shamed her, ruined her name even after death. Do you have any idea what you've done? Answer me!&quot; Eve's cheeks flushed hot with ire, her voice hoarse and thick with emotion.<br /> <br /> &quot;She ... wanted to ... be ... l-like us. We showed ... h-her.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Evelyn clenched her teeth and struck him. <i>Hard</i>. His jawbone splintered. He forced Vitae to reshape it, but she just hit him again. Chest heaving, she stepped back and let out a long sigh. &quot;You're scum. You can't even accept responsibility for your actions. You killed that girl because she was your plaything. Now you're getting what's coming to you. And you know what the best part is?&quot;<br /> <br /> Damon shook his head, his voice too weak to form words.<br /> <br /> &quot;Unlike that girl, no one will miss you.&quot; She drew her blade and slashed it across his neck. Damon's head tumbled from his shoulders, eyes still bulging. His body crumpled inward, decaying in mere moments and falling to wet pieces. The severed head broke apart like a rotten Halloween pumpkin. Soon all the soft tissue turned to ash, along with the stake she'd used.<br /> <br /> Evelyn was long gone by then. The night was cold but her wrath still burned hot. She needed to get that foul taste out of her mouth, but first she had a meeting with the editor of that newspaper.<br /> <br /> <i>Time to print a correction</i>. <i>Front page.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":109,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","user":"Claire Redfield","date":". 11-12-2015, 07:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-16T05:23:16-08:00","id":767001,"title":"","content":"So will Secrets of the Covenants be out for Christmas? I need to know what to ask Santa for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Pos